        across the full stack for Fortune 500 companies, federal agencies, and startups,
        shipping everything from real-time GIS platforms and PCI-compliant payment
        gateways to AI-driven underwriting pipelines. Right now I'm deep in early-stage
        fintech, architecting backend infrastructure from first commit. I like hard
        problems, small teams, and code that earns its complexity.
      </p>
